(b1) 8  12702627 12713026 12725306 12800464 13113580 4154554 4165178 4466638
(b2) 1  4154505   (cause NOT established)
(c) 2 PURE 12863111 4164962  +  1 MIXED 4179135          = 15 of 1,100 cells
```

