stock and the PRE-AMENDMENT runner — shipped payloads ES 1175 / LYO 297 / LDN 706 against T07's
1174 / 509 / 1240, prereg `7ce1c041…` against the frozen `e1f2822a…`, runner `6bd2e4e0…` against
