`halt_rule` is `delimiter_loss < 0.05 AND activity_entropy < 1.50`, strict on both arms (`V4.d`):

| arm | delim (forced, D-S4-4) | delim (all, pre-ruling) | act2-slot | entropy | `G4.2` |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|
